{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42279","headline":"送高起居之泾县 · 徐铉","name":"送高起居之泾县","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"右史罢朝归，之官句水湄。\n别我行千里，送君倾一巵。\n酒罢长叹息，此叹君应悲。\n乱中吾道薄，卿族旧人稀。\n胡爲佩铜墨，去此白玉墀。\n吏事岂所堪，民病何可医。\n藏用清其心，此外慎勿爲。\n县郭有佳境，千峰谿水西。\n云树杳回合，岩峦互蔽亏。\n弹琴坐其中，世事吾不知。\n时时寄书札，以慰长相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}